<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK JUNE LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 6.51 BILLION.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK JUNE LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 6.51 BILLION.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on</p>
<p>Monday the required daily money market liquidity balance for the</p>
<p>rest of the month was 6.51 billion markka.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for June 18		     6,950</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for June	     6,350</p>
<p> Average reserves to June 15			  6,199</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    6,511</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
